      "text": "To determine the total dollar amount in base 10, we first need to convert each base 5 number to its base 10 equivalent.\n\n**1. Converting \\(3124_{5}\\) to base 10:**\n\nWe start by expressing the number \\(3124_5\\) in base 10:\n\\[\n3124_5 = 3 \\cdot 5^3 + 1 \\cdot 5^2 + 2 \\cdot 5^1 + 4 \\cdot 5^0\n\\]\n\nCalculate each term:\n\\[\n3 \\cdot 5^3 = 3 \\cdot 125 = 375\n\\]\n\\[\n1 \\cdot 5^2 = 1 \\cdot 25 = 25\n\\]\n\\[\n2 \\cdot 5^1 = 2 \\cdot 5 = 10\n\\]\n\\[\n4 \\cdot 5^0 = 4 \\cdot 1 = 4\n\\]\n\nAdd these values together:\n\\[\n375 + 25 + 10 + 4 = 414\n\\]\n\nThus, \\(3124_5 = 414_{10}\\).\n\n**2. Converting \\(3122_{5}\\) to base 10:**\n\nSimilarly, convert \\(3122_5\\) to base 10:\n\\[\n3122_5 = 3 \\cdot 5^3 + 1 \\cdot 5^2 + 2 \\cdot 5^1 + 2 \\cdot 5^0\n\\]\n\nCalculate each term:\n\\[\n3 \\cdot 5^3 = 3 \\cdot 125 = 375\n\\]\n\\[\n1 \\cdot 5^2 = 1 \\cdot 25 = 25\n\\]\n\\[\n2 \\cdot 5^1 = 2 \\cdot 5 = 10\n\\]\n\\[\n2 \\cdot 5^0 = 2 \\cdot 1 = 2\n\\]\n\nAdd these values together:\n\\[\n375 + 25 + 10 + 2 = 412\n\\]\n\nThus, \\(3122_5 = 412_{10}\\).\n\n**3. Converting \\(124_5\\) to base 10:**\n\nFinally, convert \\(124_5\\) to base 10:\n\\[\n124_5 = 1 \\cdot 5^2 + 2 \\cdot 5^1 + 4 \\cdot 5^0\n\\]\n\nCalculate each term:\n\\[\n1 \\cdot 5^2 = 1 \\cdot 25 = 25\n\\]\n\\[\n2 \\cdot 5^1 = 2 \\cdot 5 = 10\n\\]\n\\[\n4 \\cdot 5^0 = 4 \\cdot 1 = 4\n\\]\n\nAdd these values together:\n\\[\n25 + 10 + 4 = 39\n\\]\n\nThus, \\(124_5 = 39_{10}\\).\n\n**4. Summing the converted amounts:**\n\nNow, add the base 10 equivalents of the three amounts:\n\\[\n414 + 412 + 39\n\\]\n\nCalculate the sum:\n\\[\n414 + 412 = 826\n\\]\n\\[\n826 + 39 = 865\n\\]\n\nThus, the total dollar amount accumulated by the pirate is:\n\\[\n\\boxed{865}\n\\]",
